   "role": "greeting",
   "phrasing": "greet_17"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Pretty good so far.",
   "est_sec": 1.34,
   "gap_before": 0.56,
   "event": "greeting_answer",
   "phrasing": "greet_ans_29"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Do I actually need a screen protector? The guy at the shop was very pushy about it.",
   "est_sec": 5.37,
   "gap_before": 0.59,
   "event": "ordinary_request",
   "block": "smartphones.dlg23"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Modern screens are tough against scratches, but they still crack when dropped. A protector mostly takes the hit instead of the screen.",
   "est_sec": 6.92,
   "gap_before": 0.41,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "smartphones.dlg23"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "I drop my phone constantly. Like, daily.",
   "est_sec": 2.27,
   "gap_before": 0.36,
   "event": "ordinary_request",
   "block": "smartphones.dlg23"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Then yes, it's cheap insurance. A tempered glass one is worth it, and you can put it on yourself.",
   "est_sec": 5.99,
   "gap_before": 1.19,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "smartphones.dlg23"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "I always get bubbles",
   "est_sec": 1.34,
   "gap_before": 1.37,
   "event": "distractor",
   "kind": "pause",
   "block": "smartphones.dlg23"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "when I try.",
   "est_sec": 1.03,
   "gap_before": 1.52,
   "event": "ordinary_request",
   "block": "smartphones.dlg23"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Do it in a steamy bathroom after a shower, there's less dust floating around. Many come with a frame that lines it up for you.",
   "est_sec": 7.85,
   "gap_before": 1.04,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "smartphones.dlg23"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "The bathroom trick. Okay, I'm intrigued.",
